# PolinRider sweep allowlist.
#
# Format:  owner/repo:path-glob      (one per line, each preceded by a "# why:")
#
# Every entry here is a permanent hole. Narrow the pattern before widening this
# file. NEVER allowlist a whole repository - a compromised repo would then be
# invisible. Suppressed findings are still printed, tagged SUPPRESSED, so the
# hole stays visible in every run.

# why: this repo IS the detection tooling; the scanner and its tests quote every
# indicator as literal text. Scoped to the known files, not the repo.
dotCMS/polinrider-scanner:polinrider_scan.sh
dotCMS/polinrider-scanner:org_sweep.sh
dotCMS/polinrider-scanner:test_*.sh
dotCMS/polinrider-scanner:README.md
dotCMS/polinrider-scanner:HANDOFF.md
dotCMS/polinrider-scanner:incident-report-*.md
dotCMS/polinrider-scanner:continuous-monitoring-plan.md
dotCMS/polinrider-scanner:sweep-allowlist*

# why: incident documentation quotes the three campaign terms verbatim as the
# detection rule. Path-scoped: any OTHER file in core is still scanned.
dotCMS/core:docs/backend/HANDOFF-continuous-monitoring.md
